1
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,960
Dare to compete against Auem?

2
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,440
Compete?

3
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,120
Compete in what?

4
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,280
A buffalo contest.

5
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:42,560
I'll teach Auem how to raise a buffalo
to compete against your big farm.

6
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,120
We'll open
a Thai buffalo conservation center too.

7
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,920
Tik.

8
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:52,840
An old buffalo expert
who never leaves his own pen

9
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:55,240
thinks he can train this girl to beat me?

10
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:58,760
Yeah. See you at the next contest.

11
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:03,240
I'll watch this girl's buffalo

12
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,600
beat yours.

13
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,440
And she'll have two million baht
to buy her buffalo back.

14
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,360
Bring it on.

15
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,960
If you've got the guts, so do I, Tik.

16
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,520
But if you lose to me,

17
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:17,200
you'll have to give me Por Chang's semen.

18
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,640
Deal.

19
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,120
Get ready to apologize to these kids.

20
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,600
I'm sorry, Uncle.
I promise I won't do it again.

21
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:01,280
And I'm sorry, Auem, Din, and Rung.

22
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,080
I've gotten you all into trouble again.

23
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:08,280
I know you wanted to help me, Ob.

24
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,640
But next time,
tell me if anything comes up.

25
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,720
Understand?

26
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,680
And don't trust people so easily.

27
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:19,880
No one cares about us
more than our own family.

28
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:30,040
Can I go in and apologize
to Por Chang too?

29
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,520
Ob wants to apologize to you.

30
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:54,520
Por Chang, I'm sorry.

31
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:07,880
He certainly lives up to his name.
He's huge.

32
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,600
And he's got excellent features too.

33
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,000
Uncle Tik.

34
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:15,680
I've never seen
such a magnificent giant buffalo.

35
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,560
Din raises buffaloes too.

36
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:23,320
With a buffalo this beautiful,
why don't you enter him in contests?

37
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,560
I used to.

38
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,960
But once he became well-known,

39
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:32,720
people wanted to buy his semen
or bring their females to breed with him.

40
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,680
I'm easily annoyed.
I don't like being bothered.

41
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,080
I see.

42
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:40,160
If you're so protective
of Por Chang's semen,

43
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,520
why did you bet it against Sia Aun?

44
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,240
Why?

45
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:47,480
Don't you think you can beat him, Auem?

46
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,120
It's not that, Uncle.

47
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,880
I'll give it everything I've got.

48
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:54,080
And I'm ready to learn
anything you can teach me.

49
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:56,920
It's not just about beating Sia Aun.

50
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,720
I want to open a conservation center
and get Hom Thong back too.

51
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,120
But…

52
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:07,560
He was right about one thing.

53
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:11,600
I can't even lead a buffalo
out of its pen.

54
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,520
Auem.

55
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,120
As long as you don't give up,

56
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,240
no one will ever look down on you again.

57
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,600
BOONYOD FARM

58
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,040
You want to get
your buffalo back from Sia Aun,

59
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,800
but you're going to compete against him?

60
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,600
What were you thinking, Auem?

61
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,600
And who is this Uncle Tik anyway?

62
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,960
You barely know him,
and you already trust him?

63
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:55,640
Come on, Mom. Uncle Tik
is an experienced buffalo expert.

64
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,840
If you don't believe me…

65
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:04,840
And he even knew Dad.

66
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:08,120
He's the one who can help us
beat Sia Aun for sure.

67
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,400
So proud.

68
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,760
-Come on, Mom!
-Proud of what? Huh?

69
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:16,840
Hey! He was going to send you to jail,
and you're still praising him?

70
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:19,480
Mom, Ob really did do something wrong.

71
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:24,360
Why don't you two

72
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,960
just stop worrying about buffaloes?

73
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:31,600
Forget about Hom Thong.
We can just buy another buffalo.

74
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:34,320
Or better yet, sell them all.

75
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:39,080
We can use the money to pay off the debt
and stop struggling.

76
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:42,040
No, Mom. Hom Thong is Dad's buffalo.

77
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,880
I'm getting him back no matter what.

78
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:47,160
And if we win the contest,
we'll have money to pay off our debts too.

79
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,920
Come on! Look at your dad.

80
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:54,600
He entered all those contests.
Did he ever make much money?

81
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:59,000
The prize money may be small,
but our buffalo will become famous, Mom.

82
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,680
And once he's famous,
we can make more money.

83
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:04,760
Selling semen, offering breeding services,
promoting products,

84
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,000
-and lots of other things.
-Right.

85
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:09,360
I don't care. I'm going to win.

86
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:11,640
I'll earn enough to buy Hom Thong back.

87
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:14,920
You can do it!

88
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,760
Fine, fold them yourself.

89
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:22,720
I'm sick of folding laundry.
What are you looking at? I'm fed up.

90
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,520
They never listen.

91
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,680
Everything I say
goes in one ear and out the other.

92
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:31,320
Do they ever listen to me?

93
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,760
You can do it, Auem! You've got this!

94
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,280
MONEY TO BUY BACK HOM THONG

95
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,560
1,000,000 BAHT FROM SIA AUN
300,000 BAHT FROM RUT

96
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:50,320
700,000 BAHT STILL NEEDED

97
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,560
I want to pay off this debt
as soon as possible.

98
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:55,920
Then Hom Thong can help us
earn money to pay off the rest.

99
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,320
There's a buffalo contest
in Korat next month.

100
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:01,840
Sia Aun enters buffaloes
in every category there every year.

101
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,800
If we can beat him,
our buffalo will become famous

102
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,040
and we can make money from that.

103
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,720
In that case,

104
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,920
we need to enter a male buffalo

105
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,600
because we can collect semen from a male.

106
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:19,120
If we win, our buffalo's value will go up.

107
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:23,800
I once watched a video
of Chang Udon having his semen collected.

108
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:27,120
They got 12 cc.
If we divide that into 500 doses,

109
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:28,680
we can sell each for 500 baht.

110
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:32,280
That's 250,000 baht
from just one collection.

111
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,600
Yeah.

112
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:38,520
If we win, one month's semen sales
could buy Hom Thong back.

113
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,919
But I don't have any male buffaloes.

114
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,200
What about Phet Kla?

115
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:56,840
I've talked it over with Dad.
I want to combine

116
00:08:56,920 --> 00:09:00,440
our buffalo herds.
Then we can become partners

117
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:04,640
and run a buffalo farm together.
We'll split the profits fifty-fifty.

118
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:09,320
I agree with Din.
With someone helping you,

119
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,400
you'll have a better chance of succeeding.

120
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,520
Deal.

121
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,280
Let's beat Sia Aun together.

122
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,400
-Dindaen.
-Yes, Uncle?

123
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:39,480
Phet Kla came third
in the last contest, right?

124
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:43,040
Yes. The judges said
his chest was too narrow

125
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:45,360
and his rear was too saggy.

126
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:51,160
We can make his chest look wider
by adjusting his stance.

127
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:54,040
As for his saggy rear,

128
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,640
we can fix that
by taking him on plenty of walks.

129
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:04,520
But for this contest,
I want Auem to lead the buffalo.

130
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,480
Huh?

131
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,480
Why me, Uncle?

132
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,800
I want Sia Aun to see

133
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:15,600
just how capable the girl
he said couldn't even lead a buffalo is.

134
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:20,000
Go for it, Auem.
A woman leading a buffalo is so cool.

135
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,400
Okay.

136
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:30,000
Then I'll do my best.

137
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:34,320
I'll pick you up on Fridays, Saturdays,
and Sundays to train Auem here.

138
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:36,280
As for Mondays through Thursdays,

139
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,640
Auem can call you if she has any problems.

140
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,840
Sure. Happy to help.

141
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:44,760
Uncle, why don't you install
a security camera in Por Chang's pen?

142
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,880
What for?

143
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,720
So you can keep an eye on him
when you're away.

144
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,360
That's a good idea.

145
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,200
What?

146
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:03,800
They're entering Phet Kla?

147
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:06,120
Yes, Boss. In that case,

148
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:09,040
should we enter Khun Suek
against Phet Kla?

149
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,560
We beat him at the last contest.

150
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,320
But if Tik

151
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:18,480
manages to fix Phet Kla's flaws,

152
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:21,400
We'll need a buffalo
better than Khun Suek.

153
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,520
Enter Thong Tae.

154
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:40,120
He's growing nicely. He's perfect
for the senior milk-tooth class.

155
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,840
He's as well-proportioned as Khun Suek.

156
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:46,000
And enter Hom Thong
in the junior class as usual.

157
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:49,560
Get every one of our buffaloes ready.

158
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,600
I'm not losing to him this time.

159
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,720
Yes, Boss.

160
00:11:58,160 --> 00:12:00,480
ANIMAL FEED FOR SALE

161
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,160
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Your digestion hasn't been great lately,</font></font></i>

162
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:07,280
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and your poop smells.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Behave, or I'll take you to the vet!</font></font></i>

163
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:10,240
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Don't worry, Auem.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I've got just the thing.</font></font></i>

164
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Here!</font></font></i>

165
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:15,520
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Here it is! A supplement for your</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">beloved buffaloes and other farm animals.</font></font></i>

166
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:19,600
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">This supplement improves digestion</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and reduces odors and germs.</font></font></i>

167
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:22,480
I saw Auem
posting product reviews on TikTok,

168
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:26,200
so I thought we could have Auem
bring her buffaloes

169
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,520
to our supermarket
and sell our products live, Dad.

170
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,680
Like when we had a booth
at the Mini Farm Fair.

171
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:34,080
Our sales were much higher
than at other events.

172
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:35,760
Sounds good.

173
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,480
Then you two should talk to Auem

174
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:41,080
and ask how much she'd charge
to bring her buffaloes here

175
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,760
and sell our products live.

176
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,480
Just you wait, Rut.

177
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:54,640
I'll make sure that Auem
gets fired from the company.

178
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:06,800
Hom Ngern, I'm entering a buffalo contest

179
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:09,240
to earn enough money
to buy Hom Thong back.

180
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,800
I promise, within six months,

181
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,920
you'll be reunited with your son.

182
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:21,840
And Auem's going to lead
Phet Kla herself, Hom Ngern.

183
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,200
-What are you doing, Mom?
-Hey!

184
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,680
Shh! Keep it down.

185
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,800
Ob, Auem, have you seen your mom?

186
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:43,000
I wanted to go to the market with her,
but I can't find her.

187
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,040
Hom Ngern!

188
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:56,920
Why are you walking away?
You should be helping me!

189
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:58,760
Stop right there.

190
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,840
-Come on.
-Where?

191
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,880
-To the market.
-I'm not going.

192
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:05,040
-Come on!
-I said I'm not going, Sa-Ang!

193
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,240
-You're coming!
-No, I'm not!

194
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,240
I've been selling meatballs all day.

195
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:12,960
And now you want me to go to the market?
No way. I'm exhausted!

196
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,160
Hey, stop being so dramatic.

197
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:17,520
Just a few days of selling,
and you're already complaining?

198
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,360
I'm tired.

199
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,040
Then how will you manage
when we set up a booth in Korat?

200
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:23,400
Korat? What Korat?

201
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:27,800
The buffalo contest in Korat
has a food section, Mom.

202
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:31,640
So I booked a booth for you and Auntie
to sell freshly made meatballs.

203
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,720
What?

204
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,760
You didn't even ask me first?

205
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:38,760
Auntie said your meatballs
were selling really well. So I thought

206
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:42,480
you should try selling them
somewhere else. That's why I booked it.

207
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:47,120
Why is my daughter always causing trouble?
First the buffalo contest,

208
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,680
and now selling meatballs!

209
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,600
Hey! What kind of mother are you?

210
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:55,280
Instead of encouraging her,
you keep putting her down.

211
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:59,120
I don't care. You're going there
to sell meatballs, no matter what.

212
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:03,440
Ob and Auem are working hard
at buffalo contests to pay off the debt.

213
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:06,520
You're their mother.
You should be helping them.

214
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:13,000
-Hey!
-Please, Mom.

215
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:23,480
Today, we'll start training Phet Kla
for the buffalo contest in Korat.

216
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,360
First, we need to prepare
high-protein feed

217
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,680
to help Phet Kla build muscle.

218
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,920
For example, Pangola grass,

219
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,400
sweet grass and Malaysian grass,

220
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:38,200
or any grass that's high in protein
for buffaloes.

221
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:41,800
As the contest gets closer,
you'll need to hand-feed him

222
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,520
so he gets used to you.

223
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:52,280
As for his saggy rear muscles,

224
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:55,600
we need to build muscle
from his hind leg joints

225
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,760
all the way up to his rump
by taking him for walks.

226
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:02,040
You need to walk Phet Kla every day.

227
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:04,480
Three to four kilometers a day
to build muscle.

228
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,040
Get some exercise.

229
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:17,040
Today, I'm going to teach you

230
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:20,840
how to lead a buffalo in the show ring.
First, touch him.

231
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,520
Start at his rump.

232
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:25,080
Go ahead, gently stroke him.

233
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:28,560
Keep stroking him up to his neck.

234
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:31,160
That's it. Now stroke his head.

235
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,560
That way, he'll know
someone's approaching him.

236
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,440
-Here, hold it like this. Got it?
-Okay.

237
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,840
At first, the buffalo
might pull against you, Auem.

238
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,720
Stay calm. Don't get angry.

239
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:53,320
The angrier you get,
the more stubborn he'll be.

240
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:58,640
Good! Just like that.

241
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,560
Careful.

242
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:03,640
Auem! When you lead your buffalo
before the judges,

243
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:06,079
don't pull him or walk ahead of him.

244
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:08,079
It'll make his neck look long and awkward.

245
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,520
Come on, walk.

246
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:12,720
Go on. Walk together.

247
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,599
-Keep your wrist firm.
-Come on.

248
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,560
Hold it steady.

249
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,760
-Uncle Tik!
-Uncle!

250
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:25,000
-Uncle!
-Uncle Tik!

251
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,640
-Uncle Tik!
-Uncle Tik!

252
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,360
-Where is he?
-Yeah?

253
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,680
Oh! Uncle!

254
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,000
What is it? I'm right here.

255
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,360
Uncle.

256
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,360
What is it?

257
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:39,520
Have you seen this poster
for the Korat contest?

258
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:41,520
Here.

259
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:48,040
They've added another category
for giant buffaloes at the Korat contest.

260
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,760
Would you consider entering Por Chang?

261
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,600
Better not.

262
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:56,120
I think entering Phet Kla is enough.

263
00:17:56,640 --> 00:18:00,560
But Por Chang's so handsome.
You should show him off.

264
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:04,000
Show everyone Sia Aun isn't the only one
with beautiful buffaloes.

265
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,040
Uncle.

266
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:12,560
Would you consider letting Por Chang
join the farm Din and I are running?

267
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:18,360
With him at our farm,
we'd have a wider variety of buffaloes.

268
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:20,240
Then we could compete against Sia Aun.

269
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:28,240
If you can lead Chang
out of his pen, Auem,

270
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:31,800
I'll let him join the farm
you and Dindaen are running.

271
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,240
Deal?

272
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:36,920
Deal.

273
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:06,640
Por Chang.

274
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,920
Come out of your pen with me, okay?

275
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,040
Let's go.

276
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:16,800
Come on.

277
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:29,960
Por Chang, I'll take you for a walk.

278
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,040
Let's go together, okay?

279
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,720
You okay, Auem?

280
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:44,120
-Auem. I looked it up online.
-Yeah?

281
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,320
They say

282
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:48,120
to try talking nicely to the buffalo.

283
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,880
There's no other way.

284
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:52,040
Din asked in a buffalo lovers' group,

285
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,320
but nobody replied.

286
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:59,480
Hey, why don't we look
through Dad's notebooks?

287
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:01,560
When he was raising buffaloes,

288
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,160
he wrote down all sorts of things.

289
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:06,240
Maybe he wrote down a way to handle this.

290
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,800
Yeah, good idea.

291
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:18,080
Ow, Mom!

292
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:20,240
See? You're hurt!

293
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:23,240
-It wouldn't hurt if you weren't so rough.
-Here, let me.

294
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:26,360
Is this gentle enough?

295
00:21:28,760 --> 00:21:32,360
Oh, you're covered in bruises. Goodness!

296
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,520
All over your body!

297
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:40,120
These will leave scars.

298
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,840
BOONYOD FARM

299
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:01,040
"Hom Ngern has been with us
for two whole months now."

300
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:04,320
"I'm only now realizing
how hard it is to raise show buffaloes."

301
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:07,920
"The buffalo and I
have to learn together."

302
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:18,000
"I've learned that every buffalo
really does have its own personality."

303
00:22:18,520 --> 00:22:20,960
"Dech's Sai Phet
likes having his head stroked."

304
00:22:22,040 --> 00:22:25,240
"Sing's King Kong likes having
his neck scratched and back rubbed."

305
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:29,520
"But Hom Ngern
seems to prefer belly scratches."

306
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:31,960
"She melts every time."

307
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:35,160
"Hom Ngern was so smart today."

308
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:37,400
"She's starting to recognize Ob."

309
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:39,200
"She can recognize Auem's voice too."

310
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:42,680
"But Hom Ngern
really loves soaking in water."

311
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:44,400
"That's my girl."

312
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:47,320
"When she grows up
and the males come calling,

313
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:48,880
will she give me a headache?"

314
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:58,960
"Today, I taught Ob

315
00:22:59,040 --> 00:23:00,800
that if you want a buffalo to trust you,

316
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:04,200
don't just approach it
when you need it to work."

317
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:08,520
"Otherwise, it'll think
you're there to force it."

318
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:12,000
"Spend time around it
so it gets used to you."

319
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:15,000
"Treat it like part of the family."

320
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,120
"Hom Ngern was paying more attention

321
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,480
than Ob."

322
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:30,960
"The longer I raise Hom Ngern,
the more I realize that buffaloes

323
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:33,720
have feelings, even if they can't talk."

324
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:39,240
"I scolded her a little today,
and she turned her back on me."

325
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,800
"You have to raise buffaloes with love,

326
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,520
not just feed them grass."

327
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:08,560
Auem.

328
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,760
What are you up to?

329
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:16,840
I read Dad's notebooks,
so I wanted to try something.

330
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:35,720
He's turned to look.
I think Por Chang likes it, Auem.

331
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,360
-Really?
-Yeah.

332
00:25:11,120 --> 00:25:12,840
Thank you, Por Chang.

333
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,560
Let's go.

334
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:23,200
Come on. Come.

335
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:28,840
Keep going. Nice and easy.

336
00:25:46,800 --> 00:25:49,200
Tik's entering Por Chang
in the giant buffalo category?

337
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:50,400
Yes, Boss.

338
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:05,040
Dad.

339
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:08,560
Ob and I are going to the buffalo contest
in Korat today.

340
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:12,560
Please help us win
so we can pay off our debt

341
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,640
and finally buy Hom Thong back.

342
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:18,160
And if anyone tries to hurt us
or get in our way,

343
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:22,520
please keep them away
and protect us from harm.

344
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,480
Sadhu.

345
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:28,360
Praying won't help you win.

346
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:32,080
Sia Aun has loads of buffaloes,
and they're better-looking than yours.

347
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:34,960
Hey, if you're not going to help,
at least don't discourage us.

348
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:36,560
What do you mean, not help?

349
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:38,400
Whose fault is it
I have to sell meatballs?

350
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,640
-Because you want to go to a concert.
-Because of your buffaloes.

351
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:42,480
-What's wrong with my buffaloes?
-Huh?

352
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:43,920
My buffaloes help us make money.

353
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,720
-What about my concert?
-What have you done to help?

354
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:47,320
Come on! It's not every day.

355
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:49,320
-How are you helping?
-Enough! What is all this?

356
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:51,560
Stop it! Why are you arguing?

357
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:57,720
Auem, if you lose
at the contest this time,

358
00:26:57,800 --> 00:27:00,600
maybe you should find
another way to make money.

359
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:03,600
No, Mom. I'm going to win this time.

360
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:06,920
I'll prove to you that buffaloes
really can help us make money.

361
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,080
Exactly.

362
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:14,160
NAKHON RATCHASIMA

363
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,680
Come on. Easy, boy.

364
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:39,000
Hold him.

365
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:16,560
Khun Khao gets more impressive
as he grows, Boss.

366
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:19,400
-He's entering the giant buffalo category?
-Yes.

367
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:23,600
I've also entered Hom Thong and Thong Tae
in the junior and senior categories.

368
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:26,040
Wow, all your buffaloes look amazing.

369
00:28:26,120 --> 00:28:29,560
-You're sure to sweep the awards.
-Oh, I wouldn't go that far.

370
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,560
Can I take a picture?

371
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,600
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

372
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:33,000
Excuse me. Coming through.

373
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:34,960
Excuse us.

374
00:28:39,080 --> 00:28:40,560
Is that you, Tik?

375
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:42,880
Long time no see.

376
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,680
It's been ages. I've missed you.

377
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:46,240
-Yeah.
-Back in the show ring?

378
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:48,800
I'm training the next generation
of buffalo show competitors.

379
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:49,720
I see.

380
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:52,840
I want the old guard to see

381
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:55,640
how much these youngsters love buffaloes
and how skilled they are.

382
00:28:56,320 --> 00:28:57,360
Khun Khao!

383
00:28:58,160 --> 00:28:59,840
Go easy on the youngsters, okay?

384
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:02,600
Oh, no need! Give it your all.

385
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:04,080
Right, Por Chang?

386
00:29:11,840 --> 00:29:12,680
BEAUTY QUEEN SA-ING'S MEATBALLS

387
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:15,640
Sa-Ing's freshly made pork meatballs!
7 for 35 baht,

388
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:18,360
11 for 50, or 23 for 100.

389
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:22,880
That's right! No preservatives or MSG,
and a variety of dipping sauces.

390
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:26,240
They're delicious! I guarantee it!

391
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:28,720
-Yeah.
-Come on over. What would you like?

392
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,600
-One hundred baht's worth, please.
-Okay. Here you go.

393
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:32,880
Honey.

394
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:35,960
What did you say to get those two
to agree to sell meatballs?

395
00:29:38,360 --> 00:29:41,360
If you sell 20,000 baht's worth
of meatballs at this event,

396
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:44,280
I'll give you back your concert ticket.

397
00:29:44,880 --> 00:29:45,760
Really?

398
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:49,000
Then let me record that as proof.

399
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,160
Forgot to scan and pay?

400
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:54,840
So that's what they're getting out of it.

401
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:58,200
Come on. Even if they're doing it
for their own benefit,

402
00:29:58,280 --> 00:30:00,800
the meatball stall I set up for your aunt

403
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:04,760
is another way to help Auem
earn money, you know.

404
00:30:04,840 --> 00:30:05,760
That's good.

405
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:14,200
Hello, everyone. In 20 minutes,

406
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:18,000
we'll begin the junior milk-tooth
male buffalo competition.

407
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:22,320
The senior milk-tooth male buffalo
competition will follow.

408
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:26,040
If your buffalo makes the top ten,
please report to the officials.

409
00:30:26,120 --> 00:30:27,000
Thank you.

410
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:29,560
Honey, Phet Kla's about to compete.

411
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:30,880
I'm going to go watch, okay?

412
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:32,120
Okay.

413
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:35,160
It's 23 meatballs for 100 baht.

414
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:37,880
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

415
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:42,800
Excuse me.
Can I talk to Hom Thong for a moment?

416
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:45,560
Make it quick,
before Khwanchai or the boss sees you.

417
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,920
Thank you.

418
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,920
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Number five…</font></font></i>

419
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:52,600
Hom Thong, I may not like Sia Aun much,

420
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:54,280
but I hope you win this contest.

421
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:56,080
I'll be cheering you on.

422
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,560
Do your best, Hom Thong.

423
00:31:00,080 --> 00:31:02,840
I'll earn enough money
to bring you home, okay?

424
00:31:08,760 --> 00:31:11,440
REGISTRATION DESK

425
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:14,960
Alright, everyone. It's time

426
00:31:15,040 --> 00:31:17,680
for the junior milk-tooth
black male buffaloes to enter the ring.

427
00:31:17,760 --> 00:31:20,120
Without further ado-doodle.

428
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:21,960
-Ado!
-Nice one.

429
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:24,280
-Give a big round of apples.
-Applause!

430
00:31:24,360 --> 00:31:25,520
Brilliant.

431
00:31:26,520 --> 00:31:28,520
It's lonely up here all by myself.

432
00:31:28,600 --> 00:31:31,560
Let's start with number 19,
a real standout

433
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:33,320
and a favorite in this category.

434
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:38,480
He previously won the Thai buffalo contest
at the Ayutthaya Soft Power Fair.

435
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:43,520
Please welcome Hom Thong
from Chok Charoensuk Farm!

436
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:49,840
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

437
00:31:50,520 --> 00:31:52,920
Hom Thong is the son of Hom Soi.

438
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:56,760
Oh, sorry!
Hom Thong is the son of Hom Ngern

439
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:59,040
and Nam Chok. He's 20 months old.

440
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:10,640
Alright, next up is Fa Khram!

441
00:32:12,280 --> 00:32:15,040
A rising newcomer in this category.

442
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:25,040
And here are our five finalists

443
00:32:25,120 --> 00:32:28,280
in the junior milk-tooth
black male buffalo category.

444
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:31,360
The first number is…

445
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:37,560
I'm even doing my own sound effects.

446
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:40,160
Number…

447
00:32:40,680 --> 00:32:42,000
Number…

448
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,880
Number 19!

449
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:48,680
Hom Thong from Sia Aun's
Chok Charoensuk Farm.

450
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:54,120
Hom Thong!

451
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,520
How are you feeling, Auem?

452
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:09,840
A little nervous, Uncle. But…

453
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:11,560
I'm more afraid of making a mistake.

454
00:33:12,080 --> 00:33:14,560
Over the past month,

455
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:16,680
you've done really well, Auem.

456
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:20,920
Once you're in the show ring,

457
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,360
if you're nervous,

458
00:33:24,040 --> 00:33:25,440
your buffalo will be nervous too.

459
00:33:27,080 --> 00:33:30,520
You're the one leading him. Guide him

460
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,680
to victory.

461
00:33:32,360 --> 00:33:33,320
That's all.

462
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:37,920
You're good at this, Auem.
I know you can do it.

463
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:43,160
Phet Kla, bring home
that championship trophy.

464
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:44,080
Go on, boy.

465
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,120
Let's do this.

466
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:50,040
Come on, Phet Kla.
Let's head into the ring.

467
00:33:51,320 --> 00:33:53,240
-Let's go.
-Go on.

468
00:33:53,320 --> 00:33:55,720
-Come on, let's go.
-Go on, boy.

469
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:56,640
-Come here.
-Go on.

470
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,480
Alright, moving on, everyone!

471
00:33:58,560 --> 00:34:01,960
It's time for the senior milk-tooth
male buffalo competition.

472
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:05,480
Let me tell you, every buffalo
that made it through to this round

473
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:07,920
is absolutely beautiful.

474
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:10,880
Let's meet our first contestant,
number 27.

475
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:15,520
Phet Kla from Dan Dao Buffalo Farm!

476
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:21,520
Phet Kla is the son of Burapha

477
00:34:21,600 --> 00:34:23,800
and Boon Fa. He took third place

478
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:27,480
at the last contest. Let's see how far

479
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:30,520
he can go this time.

480
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:34,600
And our second contestant,
number 42, Thong Tae.

481
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:38,239
Another buffalo from Chok Charoensuk Farm.

482
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:42,800
Thong Tae!

483
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:45,360
-Thong Tae!
-Thong Tae!

484
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:47,040
Thong Tae!

485
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:59,040
Din, do you think Phet Kla
will make it through?

486
00:34:59,120 --> 00:35:01,120
They've named four,
and he's not one of them.

487
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:03,400
Calm down.

488
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:07,360
I'm sure the last spot
will go to Phet Kla.

489
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:12,320
Alright, the final buffalo
to advance to the next round

490
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:15,440
in the senior milk-tooth category is…

491
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:25,040
Phet Kla, don't worry.
I know you've got this.

492
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:27,680
That last name has to be yours.

493
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:29,400
Alright.

494
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:31,840
